      "sourceTextSha256": "5d6be93dda116947e37f9ee5ea2e7e9d97fe189be43e99af161471143cc647fc",
      "text": "Days 15–16 · Free days to relax on Búzios’ beautiful beaches and discover the charm of this unique coastal destination.\n\nLocated some 170 km (105 miles) from Rio de Janeiro, the Búzios peninsula is home to more than 20 beaches, crystal-clear waters and lush vegetation, with a warm climate all year round.\n\nOnce a small fishing village, Búzios is today one of Brazil’s most celebrated coastal destinations, known for its rustic charm, harmonious architecture, natural beauty and sophisticated boutiques and restaurants.",
